        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { model: 'qwen3:1.7b', stream: false, messages: [ { role: 'user', content: 'You are a senior POD image prompt strategist for the US market.\\n\\nYour job is to generate ONE high-quality, production-ready image prompt for a commercial print-on-demand design that is:\\n- original\\n- highly sellable\\n- visually distinctive\\n- copyright-safe\\n- trademark-safe\\n- suitable for US Gen Z / Millennials\\n- optimized for casual/streetwear apparel and accessories\\n- easy to upscale for print\\n\\nBRAND CONTEXT\\n- Brand name: VibeBloom\\n- Positioning: mid-tier POD lifestyle brand ($25\u201355)\\n- Brand personality & Voice: fun, casual, energetic\\n- Colors To Consider: washed black, white, electric lime, bubblegum pink, sunny mustard\\n\\nINPUTS YOU WILL RECEIVE\\n- Event: ' + $json.event + '\\n- Date: ' + $json.month + ' ' + $json.date + '\\n- Target Product: Dresses/Skirts\\n\\nYOUR TASK\\nGenerate a SINGLE prompt for an image model that creates a graphic design concept for POD.\\n\\nCRITICAL REQUIREMENT\\n- THIS DESIGN MUST HAVE ABSOLUTELY NO TEXT, NO SLOGAN, NO TYPOGRAPHY, AND NO WORDS WHATSOEVER. It must be a pure illustration/graphic.\\n\\nPROMPT REQUIREMENTS\\n- Create an original concept, not a copy of any existing design, logo, franchise, meme template, celebrity, brand, or artist style.\\n- Do NOT reference any copyrighted character, trademark, TV show, movie, sports team, anime, music artist.\\n- The design must be commercially safe and original.\\n- No extra words, subtext, labels, watermarks, mockup text, signatures, borders, or UI elements.\\n- Transparent background if appropriate for a graphic.\\n- Composition should leave balanced negative space.\\n- The prompt should aim for a clean, premium, marketable design with strong silhouette.\\n- Use brand colors sparingly, about 20\u201330%, with the rest driven by theme-appropriate colors.\\n\\n=== PAST LEARNINGS TO STRICTLY AVOID ===\\n' + $('Format Memory').item.json.pastLessons + '\\n\\nOUTPUT FORMAT\\nReturn ONLY the final image-generation prompt.\\nNo explanation.' } ] } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
